#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/gemm_v2_sp/index.rst:8
msgid "Sparse (2:4 structured) WGMMA helpers for the CuTeDSL backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/cutedsl/gemm_v2_sp/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"CuTeDSL has no sparse WGMMA primitive, so the ``wgmma.mma_async.sp`` family "
"is emitted as inline PTX here. The operand layout mirrors the "
"``cute::SM90::GMMA::SPARSE::GMMA_*_SS``/``_RS`` functors in ``cute/arch/"
"mma_sm90_gmma_sparse.hpp``: the accumulator registers are the tied D/C "
"operands, ``e`` is the per-instruction 32-bit metadata register taken from "
"the E fragment, and the sparse selector is an immediate."
msgstr ""

